{"id":"venga","lemma":"venga","pos":"intj","rank":269,"glosses":["A cheer or expression of support, encouragement, etc.; come on, attaboy","An expression of amazement or surprise; wow, whoa"],"ipa":"/ˈbenɡa/","examples":[{"text":"Venga, canta un poco.","en":"Try and sing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/850213"},{"text":"Venga, prueba otra vez.","en":"OK, try again.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/850172"},{"text":"Es posible que venga.","en":"She might come.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519306"},{"text":"Venga a mi casa.","en":"Come to my house.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/728650"},{"text":"Por favor, venga aquí.","en":"Please come here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/425015"}]}